hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1233","Bundar told us, Muhammad bin Jaafar told us, Shu`bah told us, on the authority of Amr bin Murrah, on the authority of Abd al-Rahman bin Abi Laila, he said: What Someone told me that he saw the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, praying the forenoon prayer, except for Umm Hani, for she narrated that the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, entered On the day of the conquest of Mecca, he bathed and prayed eight rak’ahs. I did not see him praying a lighter prayer than this, except that he was bowing and prostrating completely.”"
